    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Enhancements"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>Ascension</color>\n<color=#ffffff>Description</color>\nLv. 20/20",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>Origin of Stellar Grace</color>\nThe traveler journeyed far into foreign lands, all for a slim chance at redemption."
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Lv. 40/40",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>Melody of the Astral Voices</color>\nIt is not known when the traveler gave up on capturing sounds amidst the eternal silence.\n\"If that is the case, then allow me to say a few words.\""
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Lv. 60/60",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>Boundless Journey to the Starry Sea</color>\nIn some corner of the universe, there must be answers and hope.\nHow much time has slipped way since someone looked up at the starry sky with such a thought?"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Lv. 80/80",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>Solitary Drifting of the Astral Vessel</color>\nPerhaps humans are no different from moths drawn to a flame.\nBut so be it. Even the most ordinary life yearns to survive."
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Lv. 90/90",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>Grand Wish of the Shifting Stars</color>\nThe darkness cannot dull the traveler's edge. With swords and plowshares aboard, a new beginning is well within reach."
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Tutorial",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/31/35428890/ae790115c8c9c844981bbb52d1dddb79_5471001498317990007.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "You can enhance your Exaiphanes Blade after using Cryo to awaken and connect to the Statues of The Seven in Snezhnaya."
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/31/35428890/172c0d864b6a78f3f82d0c4f448af001_9140921879543227372.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Each Statue of The Seven in Snezhnaya can bless the exaiphanes Blade once, enhancing its power."
      }
    ],
