      {
        "key": "Traveler's Path",
        "value": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "When the Traveler equips this, their CRIT DMG increases by <color=#ffffffd9>0%/6%/6%/6%/6%</color> for every Element they have resonated with. Additionally, the Traveler's ATK will also increase by <color=#36ffff>16%/20%/24%/32%/40%</color> for 8s, and regenerate <color=#36ffff>3/3/5/5/5</color> Elemental Energy, after they attack and hit an opponent. This effect can trigger once every 5s. This can be triggered even when the character is not on the field."
          }
        ]
      },
