      }
    ],
    "story": [
      {
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "Travels are full of meetings and partings.\nPerhaps the only trusty and inseparable companions of a Traveler,\nAre the sword in their hand and the dream in their heart.\nLight, even if it should last but an instant,\nCan shatter the eternal night.\nAnd thus, light descended."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
